     <P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 110pt; mso-char-indent-count: 5.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 22pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体">创先争优<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN>求真务实<SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align=center><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">绍兴一中党委承诺书</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28.5pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">为更好地发挥党的基层组织战斗堡垒作用和党员先锋模范作用，进一步保持共产党员先进性，加强基层党组织建设，经过全体党员讨论，党委庄严承诺：以开展主题活动为载体，提高党员素质保持党员先进性为核心，服务于广大师生，想师生所想，急师生所急，从而来促进各项工作，立足岗位作贡献。具体内容：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 64.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -36pt; tab-stops: list 64.5pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体"><SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore">一、<SPAN style="FONT: 7pt 'Times New Roman'">     </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体">开展“内强素质，外树形象”主题活动<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 28.5pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">深化“一个党员一面旗帜”党员实践活动，以“党员公开承诺”</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">为载体，积极开展党员责任“四个一”（即深入一个教研组，联系一个积极分子，关心一个普通教师，帮教一名学生）党员模范。五个领先：即政治思想领先，业务钻研领先，科研促教领先，协作凝聚领先，敬业奉献领先，新老党员，新老教师结对共进等活动。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 64.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -36pt; tab-stops: list 64.5pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体"><SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore">二、<SPAN style="FONT: 7pt 'Times New Roman'">     </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体">提高党员素质，强化三个意识<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 28.5pt"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt">1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">．强化“服务”意识。牢记全心全意为人民服务的宗旨，在服</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">务中提高组织的战斗力，在服务中体现党员的先锋模范作用。办人民满意教育，做人民满意教师。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28.5pt"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt">2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">．强化“率先”意识。通过强化学习．扎实工作．科学管理，不断增强素质，转变作用，提高能力，努力建设优质队伍，创造最佳业绩。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28.5pt"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt">3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">．强化“形象”意识。树立科学的发展观，正确的师生观、质量观、教育观、人才观，在求真务实中提高党员的影响力，树立党员的良好形象。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28.5pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">三、<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal">服务师生</B></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"> </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">．<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal">做好事．办实事</B></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"> <o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28.5pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">想师生所想，急师生所急。认真实践三个代表的重要思想，时刻不忘党为人民群众服务的根本宗旨，热心为师生排忧解难，关心热爱每一个学生。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28.5pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">四、<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal">促进各项工作，立足岗位作贡献</B></SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28.5pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">紧紧围绕学校中心工作，围绕创建“绍兴第一、浙江一流、国内知名”目标，统一思想步调一致，立足岗位，着眼全局。弘扬正气，做崇尚师德的表率；勤奋钻研，做教育创新的骨干，真诚协作，做团结和谐的模范；以人为本，做高效管理的能手；满腔热忱，做优质服务的标兵。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28.5pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">我们主动认真接受上级党组织和人民群众的监督，做到“言必信、行必果”，不折不扣地兑现我们的承诺，促进学校各项工作的开展。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28.5pt"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28.5pt"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 231.3pt; mso-char-indent-count: 16.52"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">中共绍兴一中党委</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
